==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spawn a few meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]; they will be your stallers. Meanwhile, upgrade your Worker Cat to max level. When the Baa Baas and Pigge appear, let them progress towards your base. When they are close enough, spawn a [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]]. Support him with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]], along with meatshields.

