==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Nara Prefecture'''.
*Nara Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Tōdai-ji|Tōdai-ji]]'s [https://youtu.be/yIKrpW8vXpo Great Buddha statue] holding the mascot character [[wikipedia:Sento-kun|Sento-kun]], whose eyes have been censored with a black bar.

